Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.00,0:01:39.00,Title,0,0,0,0,,《大雄的恐龙》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.30,0:03:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可是在人类出现在地球上以前
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.87,0:03:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久很久的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.18,0:03:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概是一亿多年前吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.58,0:03:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之是很久很久以前
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.36,0:03:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个被叫作白垩纪的时代
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.39,0:03:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个地球完全都是恐龙的天下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.00,0:03:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以说
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.83,0:03:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 小夫 开场白就省了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.13,0:03:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧 静香
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.63,0:04:01.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把超酷的东西给我们看看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.94,0:04:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想看 我想看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.24,0:04:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,再等一下 开场白是很重要的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.80,0:04:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,总而言之
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.66,0:04:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,大恐龙时代的王者就是这个
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.02,0:04:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,超级凶猛的霸王龙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.68,0:04:17.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是霸王龙爪子的化石
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.01,0:04:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爸爸从美国带来的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.92,0:04:21.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我看看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.19,0:04:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,很久以前生活在地球上的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.08,0:04:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这个东西啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.58,0:04:28.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,该轮到我了 给我看
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.73,0:04:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,真酷啊 给你静香
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.13,0:04:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我 给我 给我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.46,0:04:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,太神奇了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.33,0:04:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着它就好像回到了一亿多年前
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.01,0:04:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那郁郁葱葱的原始森林里面
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.81,0:04:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活着像小山一样的恐龙
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.51,0:04:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,看够了吧 给我看看 快点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.51,0:04:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 给你大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.72,0:04:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,收起来喽
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.78,0:04:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么贵重的东西弄坏了怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.89,0:04:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是大开眼界
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.62,0:04:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.39,0:04:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说中的恐龙化石
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.99,0:04:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是第一次看到哪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.69,0:05:01.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,真让人激动啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.63,0:05:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候还想看随时来
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.00,0:05:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么了不起的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.73,0:05:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不就是一个小小的恐龙指甲吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.14,0:05:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在就郑重宣布
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.24,0:05:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,都给我听好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.44,0:05:12.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要自己找一个来给你们看看
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.74,0:05:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是什么指甲
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.12,0:05:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是一副完整的恐龙化石
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.10,0:05:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己挖
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.13,0:05:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,真让人期待
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.72,0:05:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,又说了不该说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.72,0:05:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一生气就胡说八道
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.50,0:05:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个坏毛病怎么总是改不了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.46,0:05:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 事到如今
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.86,0:05:36.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何我都要找到恐龙化石
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.13,0:05:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且是一个完整的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.20,0:05:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管道路多么险恶
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.24,0:05:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也绝对不能放 放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.02,0:05:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这 这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.99,0:06:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,能做到的事和不可能做到的事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.08,0:06:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能想清楚了再说
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.28,0:06:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你帮帮我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.58,0:06:06.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就帮我找一副
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.48,0:06:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,完整的霸王龙化石吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.50,0:06:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是在日本
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.20,0:06:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,霸王龙之类的恐龙从来就没出现过
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.53,0:06:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.58,0:06:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本就不存在的恐龙化石让我怎么找啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.46,0:06:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.62,0:06:18.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 不行 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.63,0:06:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是这么没有责任心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.33,0:06:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己闯的祸就该自己解决
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.06,0:06:23.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一次我是绝对不会帮你了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.11,0:06:25.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就算了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.78,0:06:30.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,事到如今不能说话不算话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.12,0:06:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一个人搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.90,0:06:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是从哪里找出来这么多书啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.01,0:06:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个字读什么来着
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.81,0:06:56.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,管它呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.02,0:06:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,依靠自己的力量解决问题
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.89,0:07:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄也挺不简单的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.12,0:07:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使失败也是好事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.02,0:07:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要用温柔的目光守候他
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.06,0:07:11.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下所谓温柔的目光
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.15,0:07:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么样的呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.52,0:07:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是温柔的目光啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.90,0:07:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,书上说化石都出土于古老的岩层
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.20,0:07:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,而古老的岩层会在断崖
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.10,0:07:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,斜坡裸露出来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.42,0:07:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,凭我的直觉这里绝对有希望
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:07:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是从早上挖到现在
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.98,0:08:01.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是我的直觉有问题啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.00,0:08:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,小子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.36,0:08:06.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,快给我下来
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.19,0:08:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好疼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.42,0:08:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说怎么从早上开始
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.16,0:08:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处掉的都是泥呢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.82,0:08:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 不过您不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.16,0:08:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正好失去了耐心准备不干了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.63,0:08:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你不干了就完了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.28,0:08:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 您喝点水吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.30,0:08:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.74,0:08:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.54,0:08:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我在那儿挖一个埋垃圾的坑 听见吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.11,0:08:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.31,0:08:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是的 明明是来找化石
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.38,0:08:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,却成了挖垃圾坑
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.89,0:08:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这都怪他们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.42,0:08:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,连哆啦A梦都不肯帮我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.46,0:08:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,真受不了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.80,0:08:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这 这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.60,0:09:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,石头
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.82,0:09:16.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好重 奇怪的石头
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.22,0:09:18.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.42,0:09:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些垃圾埋起来会不会也变成化石呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.18,0:09:29.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是化石
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.55,0:09:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.40,0:09:46.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定是恐龙的蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.58,0:09:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了我找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.52,0:09:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了你挖好了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.16,0:09:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 已经挖好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.40,0:09:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,辛苦你了 来吧 请喝点大麦茶吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.16,0:10:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,大叔 这块石头我可以拿走吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.43,0:10:04.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,一块破石头我才不要呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.56,0:10:05.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.34,0:10:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的茶 小心
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.50,0:10:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.18,0:10:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,小夫 小夫 小夫
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.92,0:10:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了 来了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.39,0:10:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 请问小夫在家吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.98,0:10:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,小夫他不在家
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.92,0:10:31.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么拜托您转告他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.63,0:10:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要给他看一样东西
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.13,0:10:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,很了不起
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.72,0:10:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然是个蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.90,0:10:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,可也是个完整的恐龙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.60,0:10:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,要到预产期了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.36,0:10:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.76,0:10:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可太好了是个男孩还是个女孩呢
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.36,0:10:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,真令人期待啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.96,0:10:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说大雄你去哪儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.75,0:10:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么也不戴个帽子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.20,0:11:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是霸王龙 生出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.13,0:11:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.10,0:11:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是恐龙的蛋啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.83,0:11:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样 厉害吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.50,0:11:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是我一个人发现的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.22,0:11:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道这一定就是恐龙的蛋呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.46,0:11:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许就是一块普通的圆石头呢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.24,0:11:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是个化石
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.50,0:11:24.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可能是什么远古树木的果实
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.55,0:11:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定是猛犸象的粪球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.80,0:11:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许胡说八道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.82,0:11:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果大家都这么说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.70,0:11:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就没办法了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.76,0:11:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.71,0:11:55.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁啊 把东西乱丢
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.42,0:11:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是时间布吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.25,0:12:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下这个以前用过的呀
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.48,0:12:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,用它包住的东西就可以恢复从前的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.62,0:12:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要让它恢复到一亿年以前原来的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.46,0:12:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,就知道它究竟是什么了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.80,0:12:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的好期待啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.20,0:12:28.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.24,0:12:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.31,0:12:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.22,0:12:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.62,0:12:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么大白天的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.63,0:12:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,躺在这儿睡大觉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.30,0:12:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,小夫他们已经来了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.20,0:12:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上就去
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.52,0:12:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像挺费时间的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.55,0:12:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.38,0:12:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,要回到1亿年前着急也没用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.80,0:12:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以说
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.33,0:12:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可听说了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.23,0:12:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么了不起的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.00,0:12:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 还得稍等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.44,0:12:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.54,0:13:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说嘛 我就知道会这样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.25,0:13:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.14,0:13:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.65,0:13:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.41,0:13:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 准是那么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.08,0:13:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么呀 其实 我
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.98,0:13:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了我们回家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.30,0:13:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见喽
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.52,0:13:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的没有撒谎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.99,0:13:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且也不是什么化石
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.10,0:13:26.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是活的会动的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.30,0:13:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我撒谎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.44,0:13:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就用鼻子吃面条
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.73,0:13:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚才说的话可别忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.34,0:13:36.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,一言为定哦
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.74,0:13:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,用鼻子吃面条
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.88,0:13:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,又说了不该说的话
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.18,0:13:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.46,0:14:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.71,0:14:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.90,0:14:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,果然是个蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.02,0:14:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对没错 是一个蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.83,0:14:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.16,0:14:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,疼吗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.32,0:14:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然疼了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.93,0:14:34.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看真的是一个恐龙蛋哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.50,0:14:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉害吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么说呢 也有可能是古代的蛇蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.23,0:14:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者是新生代恐鸟的蛋呀
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.46,0:14:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这绝对是恐龙
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.29,0:14:53.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我要把这个蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.88,0:14:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,孵出来给你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.49,0:14:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 快走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.00,0:15:02.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄你干嘛大白天的盖着个被子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.13,0:15:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道是哪儿不舒服
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.86,0:15:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.88,0:15:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那赶快起来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.42,0:15:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,热死了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.68,0:15:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说大雄啊 你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.46,0:15:36.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么这个样子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.87,0:15:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点小事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.83,0:15:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点小事是什么意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.51,0:15:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说楼下的书怎么少了几本
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.22,0:15:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来在这儿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.35,0:15:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对恐龙感兴趣了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.82,0:15:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.72,0:16:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.99,0:16:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.20,0:16:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸小时候也迷上过恐龙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.29,0:16:08.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,也到处去挖过
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.06,0:16:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,可最后什么都没挖出来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.00,0:16:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,还曾经被凶巴巴的大叔骂过哪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.61,0:16:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你一定是有什么原因
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.60,0:16:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,才会这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.45,0:16:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是不能给妈妈添麻烦哦
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.52,0:16:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来爸爸也做过这样的事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.40,0:16:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 我可是发现了恐龙的蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.39,0:16:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,它动了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.16,0:16:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,它刚刚好像动了一下啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.00,0:16:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下有希望了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.01,0:16:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,再加把劲儿
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.29,0:17:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.50,0:17:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 快点帮个忙
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.20,0:17:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.72,0:17:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能把我捆起来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.44,0:17:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己捆不上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.86,0:17:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我睡相太差蛋都冷了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.18,0:17:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太谢谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.42,0:17:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.55,0:17:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快给我解开 快 快
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.90,0:17:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,蛋要破开了 快给我解开
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.90,0:19:03.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 看到了 怎么样 你快看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.58,0:19:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个 这个是长颈龙的一种
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.95,0:19:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫双叶铃木龙
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.56,0:19:10.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,双叶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.82,0:19:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,它生活在白垩纪的日本近海
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.45,0:19:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,白垩纪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.32,0:19:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.58,0:19:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,和霸王龙是在同一个时代
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.52,0:19:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这小家伙它是不是把我当成它妈妈了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.32,0:19:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,小家伙 可是我发现了你的哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.50,0:19:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好疼 好疼 好疼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.03,0:19:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太好了 你好可爱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.44,0:19:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,得给你起个名字
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.12,0:19:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.76,0:19:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快去给小夫看看
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.46,0:19:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他大吃一惊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.10,0:19:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不去吗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.00,0:20:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行啊 如果给他看这小家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.46,0:20:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定会嘲笑说是蜘蝎什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.63,0:20:04.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不如
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.43,0:20:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,要把它养大 养恐龙
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.08,0:20:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 至少也要把它养到10米以上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.96,0:20:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,10米以上
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.63,0:20:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后来一个爆炸性的大公开
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.51,0:20:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.18,0:20:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,给他吃点什么好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.22,0:20:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.23,0:20:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.22,0:20:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,下雨的时候明明 很容易找到的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.90,0:20:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,小蚯蚓快出来
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.77,0:20:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄你练习了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.42,0:20:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,练什么呀
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.60,0:20:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,用鼻子吃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.82,0:20:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜拜
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.00,0:20:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个等着瞧吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.18,0:20:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,毛巾给你放这儿了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.98,0:21:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.28,0:21:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.50,0:21:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好烫啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.30,0:21:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.03,0:21:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.63,0:21:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把它转移到这儿来了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.70,0:21:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.29,0:21:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 过来
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.10,0:21:23.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 皮皮快吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.22,0:21:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么不吃呢
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.62,0:21:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不爱吃蚯蚓吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.82,0:21:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们吃饭喽
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.59,0:21:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.00,0:21:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不想吃饭吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.26,0:21:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.60,0:21:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要回房间慢慢吃
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.58,0:21:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起皮皮 你一定饿了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.71,0:21:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个你能吃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.58,0:21:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个呀叫作生鱼片
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.92,0:22:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我最爱吃的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.82,0:22:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 吃吃看
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.03,0:22:19.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样不好咬
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.13,0:22:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,快吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.78,0:22:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢吃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.86,0:22:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,来
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.66,0:22:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.45,0:22:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好痒痒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.93,0:22:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃得饱饱的快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.60,0:22:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快一点长大吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.14,0:22:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,给
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.80,0:23:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.86,0:23:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天乖不乖啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.91,0:23:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我和你一起玩球吗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.58,0:23:40.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,讨厌 人家今天的家庭作业像山一样多
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.98,0:23:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,看球
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.02,0:23:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.72,0:23:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.08,0:23:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了 看球
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.78,0:24:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好球 来
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.24,0:24:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好球
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.32,0:24:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你耍赖 皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.49,0:24:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这么整天关在狭小的壁橱里
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.88,0:24:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,可真可怜
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.70,0:24:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们带它去散步怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.46,0:24:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定会引起很大的轰动
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.39,0:24:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,养恐龙当宠物
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.83,0:24:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定会在日本 不
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.50,0:24:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在全世界都成为焦点话题的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.22,0:24:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是皮皮也会被带走的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.21,0:24:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,学者们为了研究它会对它进行解剖
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.22,0:24:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者拿来展出
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.78,0:24:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这倒的确会成为全世界的焦点话题
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.58,0:24:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.28,0:24:56.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里都不是一个适合皮皮生存的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.72,0:25:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我吧 总有一天
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.96,0:25:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会用时光机把你送回到1亿年前的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.23,0:25:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.90,0:25:13.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是在那之前
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.90,0:25:15.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,得给小夫点颜色看看
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.88,0:25:31.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天真是太热了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.60,0:25:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,水桶里的水很快就变得热乎乎的了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.39,0:25:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是好可怜啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.33,0:25:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.30,0:25:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,真把它带出去 能行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.22,0:25:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,开心吧 皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.92,0:25:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是我小时候用的戏水池
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.85,0:26:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我也进去讨厌人家又不会游泳
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.89,0:26:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.32,0:26:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,真令人怀念
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.83,0:26:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我突然想起以前小时候的事情了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.00,0:26:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要给我老实交待
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.56,0:26:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近冰箱里的鱼啊肉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.55,0:26:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么一下子少了很多
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.73,0:26:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定是你捡了小狗小猫
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.20,0:26:17.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,偷偷养在家里吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.16,0:26:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对天发誓
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.36,0:26:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,狗啊 猫啊 我什么都没养
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.02,0:26:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着马上把它收拾干净
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.95,0:26:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.47,0:26:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果告诉她我养的是恐龙
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.62,0:26:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈一定会气疯的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.76,0:26:41.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,健康地出生了比什么都强啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.23,0:26:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,是女孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.56,0:26:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.40,0:26:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好可爱
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.17,0:26:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.66,0:26:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,长得这么快很快就瞒不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.79,0:26:50.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看还是早点
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.18,0:26:54.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不行 再养大一点
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.18,0:26:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让小夫吓得浑身发抖
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.49,0:27:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.38,0:27:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,听脚步声就认出是我了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.60,0:27:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了好了你一定很想我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.10,0:27:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只能晚上来看你真对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.60,0:27:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天的晚餐是火腿肠
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.14,0:27:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.54,0:27:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.98,0:27:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 我们一起来玩球吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.56,0:27:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好球
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.43,0:27:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,接球
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.00,0:27:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 漂亮 不错
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.04,0:28:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好球好球
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.40,0:28:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,撒了谎的人基本上都是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.08,0:28:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开始就撒谎了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.27,0:28:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,当谎话要被拆穿的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.33,0:28:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了掩饰就再撒一个谎
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.76,0:28:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样谎话就越说越多
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.50,0:28:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己也收不了场了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.47,0:28:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管笑话我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.77,0:28:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天晚上我就把皮皮彻底公开
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.10,0:28:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要让他们大吃一惊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.99,0:28:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.54,0:29:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思让你替我去给皮皮送饭了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.93,0:29:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是它不肯吃东西
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.18,0:29:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,它好像很想你的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.02,0:29:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮 皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.32,0:29:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪里呀
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.10,0:29:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许去要是病情严重了怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.82,0:29:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是老老实实地躺着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.16,0:29:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.34,0:29:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么声音
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.46,0:30:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.83,0:30:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻瓜你怎么跑到这儿来了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.24,0:30:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是被人看到了怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.32,0:30:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我也想你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.12,0:30:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我感冒好了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.58,0:30:33.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定好好的陪你玩儿
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.06,0:30:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你要忍耐一下
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.42,0:30:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我病好
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.96,0:30:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.44,0:30:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把它带回公园吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.02,0:30:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.66,0:30:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.71,0:30:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要好好的吃饭哪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.02,0:31:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 不能再拖拖拉拉的了
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.73,0:31:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真的 真的有怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.77,0:31:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,在公园的池塘里
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.27,0:31:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,脖子好长呀 我亲眼看见的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.41,0:31:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的我们已经准备就绪
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.92,0:31:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧、不会吧、不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.16,0:31:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.90,0:31:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,生物学家对出现怪兽的猜测
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.92,0:31:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,予以否定
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.72,0:31:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚将有潜水员
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.88,0:31:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对公园的池塘进行搜索
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.28,0:31:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.18,0:32:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你是谁
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.15,0:32:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是谁 我从哪里来
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.28,0:32:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些问题此时此刻都无关紧要
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.42,0:32:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,更何况为这件事我也不打算浪费时间
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.06,0:32:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,直说了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.58,0:32:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你养了一头长颈龙 是吗
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.73,0:32:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,长颈龙 你是说皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.04,0:32:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是 到目前为止
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.08,0:32:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还从来没见过如此亲近人类的长颈龙
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.35,0:32:36.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要它当然不是白拿
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.25,0:32:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要多少钱我都给你
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.45,0:32:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说你让我把皮皮卖给你
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.10,0:32:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的完全正确
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.70,0:32:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不行
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.18,0:32:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把皮皮送回白垩纪的大海
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.16,0:32:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不是开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.27,0:32:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.48,0:32:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定得弄到手
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.27,0:32:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是想尽可能避免动武
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.82,0:33:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,才到这里来心平气和地和你商量的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.70,0:33:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,又坏了我的好事
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.65,0:33:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好好考虑一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.23,0:33:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是真想让皮皮获得幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.34,0:33:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在只有一条路了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.36,0:33:48.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦给我缩小电筒
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.38,0:33:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去转移他们的注意力
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.66,0:33:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抓紧时间
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.40,0:34:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪兽在这边
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.40,0:34:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,向1亿年前的白垩纪出发
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.34,0:35:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,得多长时间
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.48,0:35:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,得有一会儿
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.34,0:35:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要带你去一个好地方
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.34,0:35:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人跟来了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.50,0:35:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧 这可是时光隧道啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.00,0:35:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是那个 不会吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.36,0:35:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,越来越近了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.92,0:35:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那个家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.60,0:35:38.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,要抢走皮皮的
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.93,0:35:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.30,0:35:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你等一下 大雄君
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.04,0:35:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下 站住
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.76,0:35:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.24,0:35:58.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再快一点
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.64,0:36:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经是极限了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.76,0:36:07.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的机器性能比我们好
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.00,0:36:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们跑不了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.64,0:36:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.44,0:36:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是能跑掉那就是奇迹
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.64,0:36:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.66,0:36:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,转向失灵 转向失灵
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.96,0:36:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.12,0:36:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下看你
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.92,0:36:52.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是进入监视区了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.32,0:36:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,后会有期
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.48,0:37:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,总算恢复正常航行了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.00,0:37:06.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.90,0:37:09.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个黑衣人他究竟要对皮皮怎么样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.20,0:37:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.56,0:37:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他要再来抢皮皮的话
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.52,0:37:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.56,0:37:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要皮皮回到它们的种群里
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.50,0:37:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就找不到了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.32,0:37:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 到出口了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.78,0:38:12.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.50,0:38:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里就是你的世界了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.60,0:38:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里 在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.44,0:38:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要幸福的生活啊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.66,0:38:30.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么多保重了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.80,0:39:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别跟过来
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.28,0:39:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到那边去 再见
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.16,0:39:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个不讲道理的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.96,0:39:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下我 皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.24,0:39:22.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是叫你别过来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.08,0:39:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,再靠过来 我就揍你了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.88,0:40:16.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄君
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.66,0:40:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 用鼻子吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.30,0:40:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我妈妈特制的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.66,0:40:27.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,等 等一下嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.14,0:40:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,少啰嗦
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.16,0:40:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好吃哦
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.14,0:40:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我我是真的养过一只恐龙
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.50,0:40:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.06,0:40:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来了 还撒谎
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.40,0:40:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个胆小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.42,0:40:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太过分了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.16,0:40:41.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们简直就是欺负人嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.90,0:40:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我倒是觉得这件事
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.96,0:40:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄你也有不对的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.90,0:40:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,男子汉做事敢做敢当
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.56,0:40:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,撒谎也没什么大不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.26,0:40:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你大大方方的承认
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.90,0:40:53.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家也不会放在心上
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.16,0:40:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么连你也不相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.46,0:40:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要证明给你们看
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.30,0:41:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好还是别看了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.02,0:41:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看了你又该难过了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.30,0:41:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,要看的不是我 是他们
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.42,0:41:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.20,0:41:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.54,0:41:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样 我的皮皮了不起吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.62,0:41:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是了不起 可是是哪个呀
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.62,0:41:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这个被欺负的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.14,0:41:27.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮 皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.34,0:41:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,它被欺负了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.84,0:41:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,奇怪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.72,0:41:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是另一个种类
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.78,0:41:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是北美洲的长颈龙
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.02,0:41:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,北美洲的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.74,0:41:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮可是生活在日本的双叶铃木龙
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.58,0:41:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是北美的长颈龙怎么会出现在日本呢
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.30,0:41:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好怪呀
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.78,0:41:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.98,0:41:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来 还是
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.08,0:41:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是什么意思
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.56,0:41:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们把皮皮错误的送到
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.35,0:42:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,白垩纪的北美洲去了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.28,0:42:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会呢
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.52,0:42:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是时光机出了问题
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.84,0:42:09.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮 我们马上过去
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.32,0:42:11.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.03,0:42:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快去救皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.64,0:42:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,可时光机
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.03,0:42:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.82,0:42:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要乱来 不要乱来
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.10,0:42:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,快
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.98,0:42:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.10,0:42:21.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.58,0:42:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,走喽
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.86,0:42:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,人太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.10,0:42:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太危险了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.38,0:42:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.02,0:42:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,讨厌
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.24,0:42:45.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,快放开
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.16,0:42:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 不行 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.28,0:43:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖虎坚持住 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.90,0:43:22.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.80,0:43:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.96,0:43:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 你们放心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.94,0:43:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.63,0:43:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦 倒无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.66,0:43:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是时光机丢了的话
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.44,0:43:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就回不去了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.90,0:44:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,无 无 无无齿翼龙
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.70,0:44:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是活的
Dialogue: 0,0:44:12.80,0:44:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.52,0:44:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦难道这里是
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.18,0:44:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 这就是白垩纪的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.82,0:44:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪儿上次和皮皮分手的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.66,0:44:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里还有我们的脚印呢
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.90,0:44:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好大啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.98,0:44:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.72,0:44:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 我是大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.16,0:44:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.18,0:45:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.08,0:45:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看不到啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.74,0:45:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好严重啊
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.16,0:45:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好疼
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.86,0:45:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是不是地方弄错了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.42,0:45:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不是 也许是被吃掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.20,0:45:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.40,0:45:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.44,0:45:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.22,0:45:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.28,0:45:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮 皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.72,0:45:53.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮 皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.22,0:45:59.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给大家介绍一下
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.56,0:46:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要害怕 这就是我的皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.40,0:46:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.46,0:46:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们错了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.50,0:46:13.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还怀疑你 请原谅
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.58,0:46:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系只要你们相信我
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.12,0:46:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,请多多关照
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.86,0:46:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.40,0:46:44.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到皮皮了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.28,0:46:47.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也是个小淘气啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.73,0:46:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好可爱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.46,0:46:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.02,0:46:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮看起来挺精神的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.30,0:46:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好吗 不错 不错 - 那快带我们回日本吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.40,0:46:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,说到这件事嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.24,0:47:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,白 白 白 白垩纪嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.10,0:47:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是说来就来的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.22,0:47:07.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天就在这儿玩一天吧 你们看怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.72,0:47:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,回去的事嘛 我看明天再说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.72,0:47:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定很好玩
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.66,0:47:11.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来不错
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.64,0:47:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,等到了晚上我们弄一个大大的篝火
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.46,0:47:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 对对
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.80,0:47:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么行啊 我还有作业没有写
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.02,0:47:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且没打招呼就在外面过夜
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.86,0:47:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,会被爸爸妈妈骂的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.38,0:47:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,作业呀
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.92,0:47:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也要在六点之前回家
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.72,0:47:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则妈妈会
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.00,0:47:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是老妈她
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.72,0:47:29.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你们不用担心
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.06,0:47:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们有时光机
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.60,0:47:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我们回到了出发后1分钟的时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.20,0:47:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这边几小时
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.36,0:47:36.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 哪怕是过几天
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.70,0:47:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至几年我们也只不过离开了1分钟而已啊
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.82,0:47:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那没问题了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.00,0:47:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们就一起在大海里游泳吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.80,0:47:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么就需要泳衣
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.46,0:47:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,用更衣照相机
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.60,0:47:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这件很可爱的
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.06,0:47:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这件够帅吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.32,0:47:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这件要像个男子汉
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.22,0:48:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我画不好
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.54,0:48:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了来吧 来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.88,0:48:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要4张一起照
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.30,0:48:05.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都站好了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.48,0:48:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,小夫稍稍退后一点
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.04,0:48:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 OK 我要照喽
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.04,0:48:15.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.66,0:48:18.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起再来一次
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.84,0:48:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,深海霜抹了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.08,0:48:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,抹了抹了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.70,0:48:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼吸管呢
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.90,0:48:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,带了 带了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.10,0:48:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这水好干净啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.84,0:48:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是啊 - 哆啦A梦也一起来就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.80,0:48:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.74,0:48:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.44,0:48:37.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们看谁游得快
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.20,0:48:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖虎你耍赖
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.96,0:48:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等我我 我不会游泳
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.96,0:48:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.96,0:48:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.64,0:48:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我们也驮上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.84,0:48:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.53,0:48:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.26,0:48:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,来喽
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.84,0:48:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了上来了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.32,0:48:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.30,0:49:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为皮皮还是个小孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.62,0:49:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄和皮皮呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.72,0:49:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,坏蛋 是你干的 等等
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.22,0:49:09.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.22,0:49:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,真热呀
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.36,0:49:33.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖虎 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.85,0:49:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好大呀
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.26,0:49:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是鹦鹉螺
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.48,0:49:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个能吃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.02,0:49:40.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好嘞
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.56,0:49:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.60,0:49:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,走开 这不是吃的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.12,0:49:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.12,0:50:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是专业的机械师修理不了啊 修不了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.12,0:50:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.58,0:50:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个是我
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.06,0:50:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要 不要
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.16,0:50:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这浓缩食品虽然也不错 可是
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.08,0:50:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果品种再丰富点就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.72,0:50:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没办法
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.88,0:50:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们原先又不是打算来野餐的
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.44,0:50:39.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.52,0:50:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,野营好开心啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.88,0:50:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,真漂亮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.60,0:50:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是1亿年前的星空啊
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.42,0:51:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,和一亿年后的完全不一样
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.28,0:51:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 说的是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.88,0:51:04.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个没有人类的时代
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.53,0:51:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,也挺让人害怕的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.86,0:51:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果说我是说如果
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.10,0:51:10.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们回不去的话
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.18,0:51:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们打算怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:11.44,0:51:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么会呢
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.56,0:51:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.92,0:51:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.46,0:51:18.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,实 实际上
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.78,0:51:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那个时 时光机 - 你等等
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.38,0:51:22.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家安静点
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.22,0:51:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.22,0:51:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是地震
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.26,0:51:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我想不是
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.88,0:51:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.42,0:51:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,霸 霸 霸王龙
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.78,0:51:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家到这边来
Dialogue: 0,0:51:42.66,0:51:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,野 野兽应该是怕火的
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.22,0:51:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 对恐龙也行得通吗
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.88,0:51:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家不要动
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.74,0:52:25.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,快回家
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.55,0:52:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,等 等 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.02,0:52:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,故障
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.60,0:52:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像是上次被黑衣人
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.40,0:52:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,袭击的时候弄坏的
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.54,0:52:40.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那次
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.68,0:52:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,是嘛 那 那 那 那么说
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.60,0:52:43.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.36,0:52:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说我们回不去了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.46,0:52:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,开 开 开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.32,0:52:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,都怪你那个破机器
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.70,0:52:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手 快住手
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.30,0:52:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是 如果坏的是空间移动功能的话
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.18,0:53:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时间移动也能送我们回到我们的时代吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.90,0:53:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.46,0:53:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是这就意味着
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.70,0:53:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须要依靠自己的双手
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.86,0:53:11.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,把时光机带回到我们出发的地点
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.70,0:53:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是要带回日本
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.38,0:53:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 因为我们现在这个时代
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.28,0:53:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,日本列岛还没有形成
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.16,0:53:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以要回到将来会成为日本的海上
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.68,0:53:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,更准确地说就是
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.08,0:53:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,东京的大雄的房子里
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.18,0:53:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄的房间里 大雄的书桌上
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.70,0:53:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,抽屉的那个位置
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.42,0:53:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,把时光机放在那个地方才行
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.00,0:53:31.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样的话
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.36,0:53:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这根本就不可能
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.94,0:53:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了 我们不是有竹蜻蜓吗
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.56,0:53:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要用缩小电筒
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.83,0:53:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,把时光机变小放进口袋里
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.16,0:53:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,再飞到日本不就行了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.22,0:53:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不行的话还有更简单的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.48,0:53:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要钻进通行圈出来就是日本了
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.78,0:53:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,天才
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.52,0:53:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是我的知己啊
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.80,0:53:50.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.72,0:53:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,首先我们的通行圈里还没有输入
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.00,0:53:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,白垩纪的地图数据
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.08,0:53:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且竹蜻蜓的时速只有80公里
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.64,0:54:01.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果连续飞行8小时电池就用完了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.08,0:54:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道从这里到日本有几千公里吗
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.32,0:54:08.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这浑球你想好了再说
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.06,0:54:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想起来了 说到电池
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.43,0:54:13.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在玩操控汽车的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.30,0:54:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果连续长时间操作的话
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.26,0:54:16.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,电池很快就用完了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.92,0:54:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果歇一会再玩的话
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.48,0:54:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是能用很长时间吗
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.02,0:54:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定竹蜻蜓也可以这样
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.72,0:54:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 如果1天飞4个小时
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.00,0:54:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后让它休息20个小时的话
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.72,0:54:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以用很长时间
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.20,0:54:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,能回家了
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.33,0:54:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一个问题让竹蜻蜓休息
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.52,0:54:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪里休息呢
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.88,0:54:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,在日本和美国中间可是隔着一个
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.53,0:54:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,很宽很宽的太平洋
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.43,0:54:48.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说我们可以坐在你的背上
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.82,0:54:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得这样不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.83,0:54:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,混蛋你又让我们空欢喜一场
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.08,0:54:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 对了很早很早以前
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.35,0:54:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,日本和美国之间的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.72,0:55:00.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,北面大陆曾经是相连的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.23,0:55:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以哪我们从北面绕过去的话
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.80,0:55:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然花点时间就算是走
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.90,0:55:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,也能走到日本哦
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.22,0:55:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.76,0:55:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在没有谁再提反对意见了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.58,0:55:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终决议通过了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.28,0:55:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,马达起动
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.56,0:55:39.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.96,0:55:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.78,0:56:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你落后了大雄
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.02,0:56:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.73,0:56:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮会掉下去的
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.42,0:56:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想看外面吗 真是
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.18,0:56:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,沿着海岸线向北飞
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.72,0:56:20.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,向北
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.62,0:56:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,向北飞
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.63,0:59:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起皮皮
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.26,0:59:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来应该更坚强一点的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.30,0:59:11.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.78,0:59:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心我会加油的
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.70,0:59:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.52,0:59:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好神奇啊
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.90,0:59:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,珊瑚在月光下闪闪发光
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.00,0:59:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮那边 是彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.56,0:59:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,夜空中的彩虹
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.53,0:59:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.20,1:00:19.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.30,1:00:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好嘞
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.23,1:00:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走了 皮皮
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.20,1:00:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你搞什么大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.65,1:00:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个家伙总是给大家添麻烦
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.08,1:00:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起我的脚
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.68,1:00:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.83,1:00:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多到极限了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.50,1:00:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦那是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.33,1:00:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.20,1:00:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.26,1:01:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都跑掉了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.12,1:01:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.46,1:01:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是桃太郎牌驯服丸子
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.12,1:01:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,联鸟龙已经是我们的朋友了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.62,1:01:21.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,请多多关照
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.28,1:01:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,好酷啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.20,1:01:26.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,上来了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.30,1:01:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发吧
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.00,1:01:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊 救命
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.35,1:02:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天晚上我们就住在火山湖边吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.86,1:02:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.90,1:02:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看那个
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.10,1:02:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好大呀
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.38,1:02:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是梁龙 不 不对
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.78,1:02:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,比梁龙还要大
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.62,1:02:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是阿拉莫龙
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.68,1:02:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,当心被吃掉 小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.76,1:02:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.48,1:02:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.26,1:02:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们是草食类恐龙 很温顺的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.48,1:02:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,别被它们踩到就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.96,1:02:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里难道是
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.03,1:02:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们的家
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.16,1:03:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢啦
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.80,1:03:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我摸到它了
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.78,1:03:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,什 什么你看我的 我这样
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.42,1:03:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖虎你好棒
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.93,1:03:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮可能不行吧
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.96,1:03:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,能在这睡个午觉
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.50,1:03:45.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.16,1:03:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去找你妈妈吗
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.42,1:03:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪个是你妈妈呢
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.18,1:04:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里太危险了 我们快离开
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.43,1:04:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 快点
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.13,1:05:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,小家伙 抓住我
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.12,1:05:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.30,1:05:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.68,1:05:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 不好了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.40,1:05:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别去 不要去啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.52,1:05:41.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,会被吃掉的
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.65,1:05:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑快藏起来皮皮
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.40,1:05:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,驯服丸子
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.15,1:05:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,别 别 别过来
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.20,1:05:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.66,1:06:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于得救了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.40,1:06:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,真酷啊 我们也要
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.58,1:06:15.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,驮我驮我
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.40,1:06:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧跟大家打个招呼
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.36,1:06:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 跟大家道歉
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.16,1:06:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好痒啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.52,1:06:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,给 你也吃点吗
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.90,1:06:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,吓唬你的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.32,1:07:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.92,1:07:05.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像情况不太妙啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.92,1:07:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看 今天还是早点降落吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.33,1:07:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.93,1:07:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可别拖后腿
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.36,1:07:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是你耽误大家
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.70,1:07:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的竹蜻蜓都已经到极限了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.54,1:07:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管怎么说先穿过这个山谷
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.48,1:07:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家加油
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.42,1:07:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.15,1:07:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像有什么东西飞过去了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.42,1:07:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看岩石是白色的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.73,1:07:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是盐吗
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.32,1:07:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.82,1:07:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好险啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.10,1:07:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,快抓住我
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.08,1:07:41.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.68,1:07:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄你好差劲啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.40,1:07:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,真差劲
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.26,1:07:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们别说那样的话了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.68,1:07:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家的竹蜻蜓都已经不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.12,1:07:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.08,1:07:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些是蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.98,1:07:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有好多啊
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.23,1:07:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是
Dialogue: 0,1:07:53.60,1:07:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不会是鸟巢吧 - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.20,1:07:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是像燕子一样的鸟就好了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.92,1:08:01.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家快跑 全速前进
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.92,1:08:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,是无齿翼龙吗
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.46,1:08:07.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 比它更大
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.43,1:08:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是披羽蛇翼龙
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.60,1:08:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.28,1:08:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 大雄
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.96,1:08:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,驯服太郎的桃丸子
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.76,1:08:24.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,找 找 找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.92,1:08:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来呀
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.26,1:09:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们又见面了大雄君
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.80,1:09:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么会一直追到这儿来的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.10,1:09:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会把皮皮交给你
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.26,1:09:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 不能出来
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.23,1:09:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看看你看看
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.82,1:09:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,一开口就这么说话
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.98,1:09:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,在今天这种情况下
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.46,1:09:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可是你们的救命恩人
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.63,1:09:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们应该微笑着欢迎我才对
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.98,1:09:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎您
Dialogue: 0,1:09:28.28,1:09:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.20,1:09:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来被你看穿了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.58,1:09:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的目标就是皮皮
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.85,1:09:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,以前我就跟你说过
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.66,1:09:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,到目前为止
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.70,1:09:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见过许许多多恐龙
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.18,1:09:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,可像皮皮这样亲近人类的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.46,1:09:44.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是头一次见到
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.12,1:09:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了你是恐龙捕猎者
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.95,1:09:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来你就是那只会驾驶时光机的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.26,1:09:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,狸猫型机器人哪
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.10,1:09:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不是狸猫
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.22,1:09:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐龙捕猎者是干什么的
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.46,1:10:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们穿越时空专门捕杀中生代珍稀生物
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.92,1:10:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后卖给那些有钱的人
Dialogue: 0,1:10:03.00,1:10:06.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,可这种行为被叫做航时法的法律严令禁止
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.38,1:10:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为它有扰乱历史的危险
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.26,1:10:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,还包括对地球环境的干预
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.18,1:10:13.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,对生态系统
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.48,1:10:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,特别是对生物进化的影响
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.42,1:10:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,原始生物的原种
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.36,1:10:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,就拿我们人类的祖先来说
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.46,1:10:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这个时代也是以哺乳爬虫形态生活着
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.18,1:10:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果它们灭绝了后果不堪设想
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.88,1:10:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论是你还是我
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.38,1:10:31.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括他自己都不可能存在了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.88,1:10:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐龙是杀不绝的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.40,1:10:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算我杀个一两百头
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.38,1:10:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没什么大不了的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.93,1:10:43.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,真残忍
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.88,1:10:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不会把皮皮交给你的
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.18,1:10:47.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 得了
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.64,1:10:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的结论不要下得太早啊
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.73,1:10:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的冒险旅行
Dialogue: 0,1:10:53.22,1:10:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,想必一定非常辛苦吧
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.76,1:10:58.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我送给你们的礼物
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.66,1:11:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且 就像我以前说的那样
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.08,1:11:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会支付可观的报酬
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.00,1:11:07.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我可以用我们的时光机
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.62,1:11:10.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你们全都送回日本去 怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:11:10.52,1:11:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,送我们回去
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.16,1:11:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,回日本
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.95,1:11:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天晚上你们好好商量商量吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.88,1:11:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 对了 你们要不要去我的基地看看
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.70,1:11:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这条河的下游
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.40,1:11:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们才不想去呢
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.66,1:11:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.56,1:11:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天早上我再过来
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.10,1:11:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是要回到妈妈身边
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.88,1:11:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是要在这变成化石
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.52,1:11:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就好好想想吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.40,1:12:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这算什么冒险 我已经受够了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.25,1:12:03.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看 我们还是放弃吧
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.33,1:12:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然他那么想要皮皮的话
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.26,1:12:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们给他就是了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.98,1:12:09.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他马上就会把我们送回日本的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.63,1:12:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的话 皮皮它就太可怜了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.08,1:12:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,又不是要把皮皮抓去吃了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.32,1:12:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会成为有钱人的宠物
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.22,1:12:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 养在游泳池里 那样不是挺好的吗 - 可是…
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.63,1:12:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你觉得
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.44,1:12:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样对皮皮来说就是真的幸福了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.22,1:12:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是为了不让皮皮
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.70,1:12:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,被人养在游泳池里
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.02,1:12:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,才一直努力到现在的
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.90,1:12:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 我们是为了要回到日本
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.38,1:12:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 才一直那么努力的 - 你说得太过分了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.60,1:12:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说对吗 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.10,1:12:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是呀
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.10,1:12:34.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要回到日本
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.65,1:12:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,和护送皮皮回家其实都是一回事
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.68,1:12:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 是一回事
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.48,1:12:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 完全不是一回事
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.12,1:12:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一回事 对吧 哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.26,1:12:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 你说的完全正确
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.80,1:12:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是目前有一个坏消息
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.50,1:12:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须要告诉大家
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.72,1:12:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的竹蜻蜓
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.90,1:12:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为刚才连续高速运转
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.50,1:12:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在已经不能再使用了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.22,1:13:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看这样一来
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.90,1:13:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只能让那家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.26,1:13:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,送我们回家了 不是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.96,1:13:12.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吗 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.12,1:13:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,竹蜻蜓已经完全不行了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.06,1:13:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们自己走不就行了 - 我走不动
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.12,1:13:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 反正陆地连着 - 我们总有一天能走到的
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.62,1:13:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要马上回家去 - 小夫你别着急啊
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.38,1:13:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上回家
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.10,1:13:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.56,1:13:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那 胖虎你来说说看
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.36,1:13:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是不是只能交出皮皮啦
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.86,1:13:38.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想 走着回去也行
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.82,1:13:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,走回日本
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.16,1:13:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:13:42.43,1:13:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄 我要掉下去的时候
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.36,1:13:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你 是你紧紧地拉住了我的手
Dialogue: 0,1:13:49.33,1:13:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,胖虎 谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.22,1:13:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是真的吧
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.66,1:14:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,光靠两条腿怎么可能走回去呀
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.53,1:14:06.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.82,1:14:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定要坚强一点
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.30,1:14:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,要知道 你不是依靠自己一个人的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.02,1:14:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,走到这里的
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.43,1:14:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是相互支持一起走过来的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.10,1:14:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙 伙伴
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.52,1:14:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮 你千万别离开我们
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.60,1:14:41.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.55,1:14:44.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮是对着哪里在叫啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.92,1:14:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个方向应该就是我们的家日本
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.18,1:14:49.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是皮皮出生的地方
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.95,1:14:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在对皮皮来说 是关键时刻
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.02,1:15:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.96,1:15:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄 对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.05,1:15:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,用脚走
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.56,1:15:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,用脚也可以走回去
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.78,1:15:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这家伙不要动不动就哭嘛
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.26,1:15:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有哭
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.96,1:15:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,大 大家 谢谢你们
Dialogue: 0,1:15:38.46,1:15:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条河水的前方
Dialogue: 0,1:15:40.52,1:15:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,在很远很远的地方 就是日本了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.86,1:15:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,可是那些捕猎者的基地就挡在前面
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.62,1:15:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能避开他们吗
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.86,1:15:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行无论哪条路都很快会被追上
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.86,1:15:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,有了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.96,1:16:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个可以用吗
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.42,1:16:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 就用它好了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.42,1:16:06.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,用它干什么
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.58,1:16:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来说
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.30,1:16:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.46,1:16:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把这个东西
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.26,1:16:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.82,1:16:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说那只不怕人的恐龙
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.78,1:16:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经弄到手了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.70,1:16:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,和弄到手也差不了多少
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.00,1:16:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该说只差最后一步了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.93,1:16:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想也许让您亲自动手会更好
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.26,1:16:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个小男孩对我的工作不太配合
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.70,1:16:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不是你在时光隧道的失误
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.38,1:16:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在应该不是这个局面吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.06,1:16:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确是那样
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.00,1:16:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,可时光巡逻队的监视也太严密了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.84,1:16:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些孩子好像开始行动了
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.28,1:17:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,来场人类狩猎怎么样
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.35,1:17:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来很有趣
Dialogue: 0,1:17:40.08,1:17:41.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.50,1:17:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,恭候多时了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.12,1:18:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,“皮皮”
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.05,1:18:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经快要厌倦恐龙狩猎了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.06,1:19:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最后警告
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.06,1:19:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,再不交出皮皮马上射击
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.88,1:19:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,以为用那种东西就能逃跑
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.98,1:19:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是幼稚
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.72,1:19:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.28,1:19:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,1:19:22.50,1:19:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我升上去
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.22,1:20:02.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有击中要害
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.28,1:20:04.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 都给我出来
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.22,1:20:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是故意留他们一条小命的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.28,1:20:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,车里什么人都没有
Dialogue: 0,1:20:08.50,1:20:09.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们被他们骗了
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.90,1:20:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么
Dialogue: 0,1:20:18.60,1:20:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,其它车里也都是玩偶
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.40,1:20:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你给我个解释
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.00,1:20:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你不会是打算让我参加
Dialogue: 0,1:20:27.72,1:20:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩偶狩猎吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.90,1:20:30.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 怎 怎 怎么可能呢
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.68,1:20:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我 我马上就去找
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.36,1:20:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去 追踪遥控器的电波
Dialogue: 0,1:20:40.82,1:20:43.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看 他们应该跑不远的
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.28,1:20:45.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次一定要给他们点颜色看看
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.12,1:20:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望这次 你能让我尽兴
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.00,1:20:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像不行了一点反应都没有
Dialogue: 0,1:20:56.42,1:20:57.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么快
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.66,1:20:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把电源关掉
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.18,1:21:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们可都是专业的捕猎者
Dialogue: 0,1:21:01.32,1:21:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,遥控玩具对他们来说是小菜一碟
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.38,1:21:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要抓紧时间尽量要走得远一点
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.50,1:21:10.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们追过来了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.18,1:21:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之前得想办法进入基地
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.16,1:21:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓紧时间
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.73,1:21:15.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,电波在这里中断的
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.38,1:21:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该就在附近
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.70,1:21:17.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去找
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.30,1:21:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们好像还没有看见我们
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.06,1:21:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好嘞全速前进
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.16,1:21:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,丛林没有了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:30.96,1:21:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.23,1:21:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,停停停停不住啊
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.35,1:21:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他们了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:50.76,1:21:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他过来了
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.00,1:21:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,快把头低下
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.30,1:21:58.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来了
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.94,1:22:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是黏着弹
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.80,1:22:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别怕 看我的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.50,1:22:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我饶不了你
Dialogue: 0,1:22:27.28,1:22:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.36,1:22:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好了 快跳水
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.88,1:22:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你们游一会儿吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.72,1:22:51.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家拉起手来
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.88,1:22:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 我绝不会松手的
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.32,1:22:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 胖虎 静香 - 小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.16,1:23:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.36,1:23:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,找找 就是它了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.33,1:23:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,交通安全护身符
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.50,1:23:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.13,1:23:49.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都没事 太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:23:52.40,1:23:54.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦你没事吧
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.62,1:24:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,静香 胖虎 小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.22,1:24:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,得去救他们
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.26,1:24:10.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.76,1:24:15.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可不能去
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.16,1:24:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静一点
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.33,1:24:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些家伙想要找的就是你
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.66,1:24:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里等我
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.10,1:24:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们给我小心点
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.96,1:24:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,小恐龙能卖好价钱
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.28,1:25:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在轮到你们了 淘气的小朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.16,1:25:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,大雄这样也不是个办法
Dialogue: 0,1:25:29.92,1:25:32.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,快一点 大家都在这里面
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.46,1:25:34.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何也得进去
Dialogue: 0,1:25:35.16,1:25:36.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,水量好像比刚才小了
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.78,1:25:38.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来想办法
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.96,1:25:39.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,哆啦A梦
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.93,1:25:42.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 放开我
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.35,1:25:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.66,1:25:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好难受
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.46,1:26:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎光临大雄君
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.70,1:26:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,狸猫型机器人
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.78,1:26:33.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是跟你说过 我不是狸猫
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.58,1:26:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.16,1:26:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就让你见他们
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.20,1:26:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,救命啊
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.33,1:26:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来了
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.38,1:26:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉打断这感人的一幕
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.70,1:26:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不如先玩个游戏放松一下
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.56,1:27:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条霸王龙饿了很久了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:07.16,1:27:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道你的朋友们合不合它的胃口
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.16,1:27:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.68,1:27:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是好险啊
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.43,1:27:27.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我要和大雄君商量点事儿
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.85,1:27:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你说Yes
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.46,1:27:30.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,游戏就终止
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.90,1:27:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你说No
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.23,1:27:34.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你这些最好的朋友
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.72,1:27:38.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会被全部装进这条霸王龙的肚子里
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.52,1:27:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了把皮皮交出来
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.10,1:27:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,太精彩了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.55,1:28:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我 皮皮在哪儿
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.60,1:28:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的想要牺牲你的朋友吗
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.43,1:28:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮它
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.36,1:28:23.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,交出来
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.96,1:28:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮 皮皮它 它
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.78,1:28:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行 千万别把皮皮交给他
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.98,1:28:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,静香
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.90,1:28:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.18,1:28:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下这里还有一个更好吃的
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.10,1:29:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这边 给你一个屁股蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:29:00.13,1:29:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你一个屁股蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.06,1:29:09.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,来一个 来一个 给你一个屁股蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.00,1:29:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边这个肉质鲜美哦
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.90,1:29:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不错哦
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.85,1:29:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 你们 你们会被吃掉的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.73,1:29:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也来
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.36,1:29:27.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,要吃就吃胖虎 要吃就吃胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.46,1:29:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这混蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.60,1:29:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样下去就真的成了游戏了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.60,1:29:49.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,1:29:50.80,1:29:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,要抓住它吗
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.70,1:29:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 皮皮什么的都不重要了
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.98,1:29:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们看看他们怎么被撕成碎片
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.58,1:30:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮 快跑
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.35,1:30:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙难不成就是
Dialogue: 0,1:30:17.32,1:30:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃了驯服丸子的
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.80,1:30:20.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那条霸王龙
Dialogue: 0,1:30:20.16,1:30:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.20,1:30:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这 这 这 这到底是
Dialogue: 0,1:30:29.96,1:30:31.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.98,1:30:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是是时光巡逻队
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.68,1:30:41.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们穿越瀑布屏障了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.52,1:30:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,进攻教训他们一下
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.20,1:30:51.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜拜
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.23,1:30:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他们跑了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.08,1:31:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住他
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.10,1:31:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好嘞
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.72,1:31:15.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,反攻到此为止吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.10,1:31:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,冲啊
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.56,1:32:05.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油啊 霸王龙
Dialogue: 0,1:32:20.52,1:32:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着时光球的引导走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.52,1:32:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.66,1:32:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这个家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.08,1:32:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的恐龙都属于我的
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.98,1:32:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经安全了
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.36,1:32:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,时光球可以用瞬间移动功能帮我们逃跑
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.60,1:33:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们全都会和这些恐龙一起
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.76,1:33:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里灭亡的
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.60,1:33:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你给我下来 - 混蛋你这个卑鄙的家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.40,1:33:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以随时随地地穿越时空
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.00,1:33:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,乳臭未干的小朋友们
Dialogue: 0,1:33:15.78,1:33:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们就乖乖地和恐龙一起变成化石吧
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.06,1:33:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经没时间了
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.42,1:33:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都钻到我的口袋里
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.22,1:33:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你了 皮皮
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.52,1:34:48.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.26,1:34:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.36,1:35:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.82,1:35:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这头棘龙的体力好像恢复了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.13,1:35:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,队长 还是找不到孩子们
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.72,1:35:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们呀 他们已经重新出发了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.32,1:35:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起我的小棘龙
Dialogue: 0,1:35:20.86,1:35:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好不容易时光巡逻队来了我们却
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.50,1:35:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.53,1:35:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,明明可以拜托他们送我们回去的
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.78,1:35:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的秘密道具也全都被水冲丢了
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.42,1:35:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不知道什么时候才能走到
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.83,1:35:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是啊
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.68,1:35:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕拜托他们把小夫
Dialogue: 0,1:35:35.10,1:35:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人先送回去也好啊
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.42,1:35:43.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了 还是用我们自己的力量
Dialogue: 0,1:35:43.16,1:35:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持到最后吧
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.53,1:35:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是伙伴吗
Dialogue: 0,1:35:49.28,1:35:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了什么好笑的话了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.33,1:35:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好疼啊 好疼啊 胖虎
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.63,1:35:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是我的知己呀
Dialogue: 0,1:36:14.92,1:36:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,没办法往前走了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:16.90,1:36:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面这块陆地已经被海水淹没了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.35,1:36:25.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说你驮我们过去
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.56,1:36:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都坐上来了一点也不摇晃
Dialogue: 0,1:36:30.43,1:36:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮长大了
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.78,1:36:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好棒皮皮
Dialogue: 0,1:36:41.78,1:36:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,全体敬礼
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.13,1:37:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个是
Dialogue: 0,1:37:20.33,1:37:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个是 那个是时光机的入口
Dialogue: 0,1:37:24.82,1:37:26.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我书桌的抽屉
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.58,1:37:28.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是说我们已经到日本了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.55,1:37:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能回去了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.13,1:37:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这里 没错
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.48,1:37:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:37:51.82,1:37:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.70,1:37:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一亿年前的日本吗
Dialogue: 0,1:38:03.58,1:38:06.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮 我们终于走到了
Dialogue: 0,1:38:07.23,1:38:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 皮皮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.16,1:38:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就OK
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.43,1:38:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像在召唤皮皮
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.86,1:38:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里就是你生活的地方吗
Dialogue: 0,1:39:38.98,1:39:39.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.18,1:39:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今后会看到各种各样的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.12,1:39:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道各种各样的事
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.90,1:39:57.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后 然后你会不断成长
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.43,1:40:03.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也 我也
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.53,1:40:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我也
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.83,1:40:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定会
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.73,1:40:16.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好加油的
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.96,1:40:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你要保重
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.12,1:40:37.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们快回去
Dialogue: 0,1:40:52.42,1:40:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟过来
Dialogue: 0,1:41:07.60,1:41:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发 快 我们快走
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.56,1:41:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了皮皮
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.90,1:41:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,多保重
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.56,1:41:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,再会
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.08,1:41:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,走了
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.10,1:41:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮皮
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.43,1:41:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了
Dialogue: 0,1:42:40.73,1:42:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好嘞
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.28,1:42:47.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这么多人在干什么呢
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.10,1:42:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,一点小事
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.30,1:43:54.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 天空飘下一丝丝的细雨 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.30,1:43:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 画面在一瞬间静止了 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:43:57.16,1:43:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 所有想念你的思绪 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.86,1:44:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 随着时光的流逝 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.53,1:44:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 一点一点的凝聚 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.82,1:44:04.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 好多思念的话 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.15,1:44:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 想要说却说不出口 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:44:05.93,1:44:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 脑海全是你的痕迹 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:44:08.65,1:44:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 努力记起 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.68,1:44:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 我们每个相拥时的深刻 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.70,1:44:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 只会笑着装傻 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.02,1:44:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 拥抱彼此相聚的时间 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.73,1:44:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 快乐伤心都陪你上演 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:44:26.00,1:44:28.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 只要有你灿烂的笑脸 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.88,1:44:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 再多辛苦也看不见 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.82,1:44:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 相信我会努力给你全世界 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:44:37.65,1:44:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 跟我手牵手大步一起走 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:44:41.02,1:44:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 享受飞翔的自由 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.53,1:44:45.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 带你看星空 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:44:45.36,1:44:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 一起数着星星温暖你心窝 ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.46,1:44:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 思念编织成的彩虹 ∮
